0377 | 
0378 | \begin{observation}\label{obs - adjointness bilinear form}
0379 | For any $\alpha \in C^{k+1}(X)$ and $\beta \in C^k(X)$ :
0380 |     \[ \langle \partial \alpha , \beta \rangle =
0381 |     \langle  \alpha , d_k \beta \rangle  \]
0382 | \end{observation}
