0419 | \begin{proposition}\label{thm : small generators}
0420 |     Let $R$ be an arbitrary ring such that $q$ is not zero in $R$. Then $Ker(\partial^{(R)}_k)$ is generated by chains $\{\alpha_i\}$, where $\alpha_i$ is contained in some $2k$ dimensional space.
