0430 |     \begin{align*}
0431 |         \alpha = \partial c_{\vec{b},\alpha} = \sum_{W \in \spp(\alpha)} \alpha(W) \partial  c_{\vec{b}, W} = \sum_{W \in \spp(\alpha)} \alpha(W) \left(  W - c_{\vec{b}, \partial W} \right)
