0439 |     And by the definition of the cone of $U$, this implies that $supp(c_{\vec{b},U})$ is contained in $W_{\vec{b}}^{t}$. In conclusion this implies that $ W - c_{\vec{b},\partial W}$ is contained in the $2k$ dimensional space $W_{\vec{b}}^{t}$ as needed.
