0723 | \begin{claim}[James \cite{JamesRepTheory}]
0724 |     The chains $\psi,\eta$ satisfy $\langle \psi_i, \eta_i \rangle = 1$. In particular $\psi_n,\eta_n$ are non trivial in $H_n(Gr(2n))$.
